    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31-a3">

                <pb facs="0139" n="35" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg35"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Decree denouncing the treaty.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Official Gazette</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-07-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 25th, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Decree No. 10,355, of the 23rd of July, 1913, published the denunciation of the
                    treaty of extradition of criminals signed in Rio de Janeiro between Brazil and
                    the United States of America on the 14th of May, 1897, and the protocols and
                    annexes of the 28th of May, 1898, and the 29th of May, 1911.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d31-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>The President of the Republic of the United States of Brazil makes public that
                    from today the Treaty of Extradition of Criminals, signed in Rio de Janeiro
                    between Brazil and the United States of America on the 14th of May, 1897, and
                    the protocols and annexes of the 28th of May, 1898, and the 29th of May,
                        1911,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d31-f2"/> has ceased to be in effect.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">July
                        23, 1913, 92nd of Independence and 25th of the Republic.</hi>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
